rchives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0016", "ticker": "AAPL", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-09-27", "section": "risk_factors", "score": 1.3287, "filing_name": "Apple Inc 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0003", "ticker": "AAPL", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-09-27", "section": "risk_factors", "score": 1.2349, "filing_name": "Apple Inc 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0028", "ticker": "AAPL", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-09-27", "section": "risk_factors", "score": 1.1603, "filing_name": "Apple Inc 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__mdna__0008", "ticker": "AAPL", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-09-27", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.7654, "filing_name": "Apple Inc 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__unknown__0015", "ticker": "AAPL", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-09-27", "section": "unknown", "score": 0.6539, "filing_name": "Apple Inc 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__unknown__0008", "ticker": "AAPL", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-09-27", "section": "unknown", "score": 0.6279, "filing_name": "Apple Inc 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm", "truncated": false}], "collapsed_near_duplicates": 4, "dropped_candidates": 52, "token_estimate": 31963, "gaps": [], "degraded": []}, "answer": {"direct_answer": "Apple's fiscal 2025 10-K (ended September 27, 2025) groups its risk factors into macroeconomic and industry, business, legal and regulatory compliance, financial, and general risks. Macroeconomic risks include adverse economic conditions and international trade restrictions, with new U.S. tariffs announced beginning in the second quarter of fiscal 2025 [AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0003]. Business risks center on intense competition, reliance on outsourcing partners and single-source suppliers, and product defects [AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0005][AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0008]. Legal and regulatory risks include the EU Digital Markets Act, antitrust litigation, and exposure to the Google search licensing remedies [AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0026][AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0027]. Financial risks cover gross margin pressure, foreign exchange, credit and tax exposure, and the filing also flags stock price volatility [AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0030][AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0034]. The latest 10-Q (Q1 fiscal 2026, ended December 27, 2025) reports no material changes to these risk factors [AAPL_10Q_2025-12-27__legal_proceedings__0003]. The filing does not rank these risks.", "company_findings": [{"ticker": "AAPL", "company": "Apple Inc", "findings": [{"point": "Trade restrictions and tariffs can raise costs, disrupt the supply chain, and reduce consumer spending; the ultimate impact of the U.S. tariffs announced from the second quarter of fiscal 2025 remains uncertain.", "citations": ["AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0002", "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0003"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Apple depends on outsourcing partners concentrated in Asia and on single or limited-source component suppliers, exposing it to supply shortages and price increases.", "citations": ["AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0008", "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0010"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Regulatory and legal risks include DMA compliance in the EU, U.S. antitrust suits, App Store investigations, and potential loss of Google search licensing revenue.", "citations": ["AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0026", "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0028"], "unverified": false}]}], "comparison_table": null, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0003", "claim": "U.S. tariffs announced in Q2 fiscal 2025", "quote": "Beginning in the second quarter of 2025, new tariffs were announced on imports to the U.S."}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0002", "claim": "Trade restrictions affect business and supply chain", "quote": "Restrictions on international trade, such as tariffs and other controls on imports or exports of goods, technology or data, can materially adversely affect"}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0005", "claim": "Intense competition and rapid technology change", "quote": "Global markets for the Company's products and services are highly competitive and subject to rapid technological change"}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0008", "claim": "Reliance on outsourcing partners and single-source suppliers", "quote": "The Company relies on single-source partners in the U.S., Asia and Europe to supply and manufacture many components"}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0010", "claim": "Supply shortage and price increase risk", "quote": "the Company remains subject to significant risks of supply shortages and price increases"}, {"chunk_id": "AAPL_10K_2025-09-27__risk_factors__0026", "claim": "DMA compliance and antitrust litigation", "quote": "The DMA provides for significant fines and penalties for noncompliance.